      "text": "Model yang dipakai: SVR kernel RBF\n\nGrid search space:\n- C = [0.1, 1, 10, 100]\n- gamma = [0.01, 0.1, 0.5, 1.0]\n- epsilon = [0.1, 0.2, 0.5]\n\nBest parameter hasil training:\nC = 100 | gamma = 0.1 | epsilon = 0.1",
